From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 23:09:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] DVDInputStreamBluray: run the disc program while a join is
 held

In navigation mode the read holds a non-seamless join until the old
item has played out, which can take minutes. An HDMV program runs only
in a read, so an activation key or a menu call made then does nothing
until the hold ends. A disc audio pick can also undo a pending jump.
---
