 .../DVDInputStreams/DVDInputStreamBluray.h    |  7 ++
 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayer.cpp        | 12 ++-
 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayer.h          |  1 +
 4 files changed, 116 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

